---
ns: home
---
{#
  index.njk — 首页（SPEC.md §6.2）

  `.main-wrap` 内 7 段，其中**第 6 段（`.horizontal-items`）在原站被整段 HTML 注释掉**，
  不渲染。本模板**不输出**它：注释节点不进 DOM，输出它只会让产物多带一段
  引用原站媒体的死代码。§6.2 已登记该段不渲染。

  首屏（`.home-header`）的文案（角色、地点、大名字）按 §7.1 的口径**直接写在模板里** ——
  `home.json` 只承载 §7.1 明确列出的"intro 文案 + 4 条 featured"。

  > **P8 已换成占位内容**（`DEVIATIONS.md` D2）：练习名「Bloom Studio」由仓库名派生，
  > **不是**任何真实个人或机构的身份。地点那三个 `<span>` 的**数量与顺序必须保持**
  > （`.hanger` 的排版按它们断行）；大名字里的 `<span class="spacer">—</span>` 同理。
  > 最终个性化只需改本文件与 `_data/`。
#}
<header class="section home-header theme-dark" data-scroll-section>
   <div class="overlay personal-image no-select once-in" data-scroll data-scroll-speed="-3" data-scroll-position="top">
      <img src="/assets/img/studio-01.jpg">
   </div>
   <div class="overlay get-height once-in once-in-secondary">
      <div class="hanger">
         <p><span>Located </span><span>in </span><span>Amsterdam</span></p>
         {% include "partials/icon-hanger.njk" %}
         <div class="digital-ball">
            <div class="overlay"></div>
            <div class="globe">
               <div class="globe-wrap">
                  <div class="circle"></div>
                  <div class="circle"></div>
                  <div class="circle"></div>
                  <div class="circle-hor"></div>
                  <div class="circle-hor-middle"></div>
               </div>
            </div>
         </div>
      </div>
   </div>
   {% include "partials/nav-bar.njk" %}   <div class="container once-in once-in-secondary">
      <div class="row">
         <div class="flex-col">
            <div class="header-above-h4" data-scroll data-scroll-speed="1">
               <div class="arrow big">{% include "partials/icon-arrow.njk" %}</div>
            </div>
            <h4><span>Independent</span> Designer &amp; Developer</h4>
         </div>
      </div>
   </div>
   <div class="big-name">
      <div class="name-h1" data-scroll data-scroll-direction="horizontal" data-scroll-speed="4" data-scroll-position="top">
         <div class="name-wrap">
            <h1 class="no-select once-in once-in-secondary">Bloom Studio<span class="spacer">—</span></h1>
         </div>
      </div>
   </div>
   <div class="white-block"></div>
</header>
<section class="section home-intro" data-scroll-section>
   <div class="container medium">
      <div class="row">
         <div class="flex-col">
            <h4 class="span-lines animate">{{ home.introHeading }}</h4>
         </div>
         <div class="flex-col">
            <div class="text-wrap fade-in animate">
               <p>{{ home.introText }}</p>
            </div>
            <div class="btn btn-round" data-scroll data-scroll-speed="2">
               <a href="/about" class="btn-click magnetic " data-strength="100" data-strength-text="50">
                  <div class="btn-fill"></div>
                  <span class="btn-text">
                     <span class="btn-text-inner">About me</span>
                  </span>
               </a>
            </div>
         </div>
      </div>
   </div>
</section>
<section class="section work-grid large-work-grid" data-scroll-section>
   <div class="container">
      <div class="grid-sub-title">
         <div class="flex-col">
            <h5>Recent work</h5>
         </div>
      </div>
      <ul class="work-items mouse-pos-list-image-wrap">
{%- for item in home.featured %}
                     <li class="{{ item.classes | join(' ') }} visible">
            <div class="stripe animate"></div>
            <a href="{{ item.href }}" class="row">
               <div class="flex-col">
                  <h4><span>{{ item.name }}</span></h4>
               </div>
               <div class="flex-col animate">
                  <p>{{ item.services }}</p>
               </div>
            </a>
         </li>
{%- endfor %}
                  <div class="stripe last animate"></div>
      </ul>
   </div>
</section>
<section class="section work-tiles work-tiles-home" data-scroll-section>
   <div class="container">
      <ul>
{%- for item in home.featured %}
                  <li class="{{ item.classes | join(' ') }} visible">
            <div class="single-tile-wrap">
               <a href="{{ item.href }}" class="row">
                  <div class="flex-col">
                     <div class="tile-image">
                        <div class="overlay overlay-image lazy" style="background-color: {{ item.tileColor }}; background-position: center center; background-repeat: no-repeat; background-size: cover;" data-bg="{{ item.tileImage }}"></div>                     </div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="flex-col">
                     <h4><span>{{ item.name }}</span></h4>
                     <div class="stripe"></div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="flex-col">
                     <p>{{ item.services }}</p>
                  </div>
                  <div class="flex-col">
                     <p>{{ item.year }}</p>
                  </div>
               </a>
            </div>
         </li>
{%- endfor %}
               </ul>
   </div>
</section>
<section class="section center-grid-btn center-grid-btn-home" data-scroll-section style="padding-bottom: calc(var(--section-padding) - 2.5vw);">
   <div class="container">
      <div class="grid-after-btn">
         <div class="btn btn-normal">
            <a href="{{ home.moreWorkHref }}" class="btn-click magnetic" data-strength="25" data-strength-text="15">
               <div class="btn-fill"></div>
               <span class="btn-text">
                  <span class="btn-text-inner change">More work<div class="count-nr">{{ homeMoreWorkCount }}</div></span>
               </span>
            </a>
         </div>
      </div>
   </div>
</section>
{% include "partials/footer-rounded.njk" %}
{% include "partials/footer.njk" %}
